tire body hurts, and I'm bleeding. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"My face must look even uglier now, worse than after being caught in the blast of that dirty bomb..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Nyto","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Nyto","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The interrogation continues. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Whenever you diverge from our information, we will consider more rigorous methods of interrogation in the future. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, amend your story."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I know, I know. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I cough up a wad of blood, which probably has a tooth in there as well. I pant heavily, and then I try to think through the pain... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It is time for another story, and I have to reconsider its...ending."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
